sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client (Web/Mobile App)
    participant Backend as Backend (API Server)
    participant DB as Database (MySQL/PostgreSQL)

    Note over Client, DB: Alur Request-Response Sistem Perpustakaan

    Client->>Backend: HTTP Request (GET /api/books)
    activate Backend
    Backend->>DB: Query: SELECT * FROM books
    activate DB
    DB-->>Backend: Return Data Buku
    deactivate DB
    Backend-->>Client: HTTP Response (JSON, Status 200 OK)
    deactivate Backend

    Client->>Backend: HTTP Request (POST /api/loans) + Body JSON
    activate Backend
    Backend->>DB: Query: INSERT INTO loans (...)
    activate DB
    DB-->>Backend: Return Success (Loan ID)
    deactivate DB
    Backend-->>Client: HTTP Response (JSON, Status 201 Created)
    deactivate Backend